    gmeow:conformanceRationale "The counter-example is a math:ConditionalProbability naming no math:conditionalOn (sh:minCount 1 on math:ConditionedAssertionShape), so validation MUST emit shacl.MinCountConstraintComponent and NO other finding (math:UnconditionedAssertion)." .

