# === Lossy dogfooding: the non-exact polarity of the probability-model lowering seam === #

ex:ecDependencyModelApproximateLossy a gmeow:ExampleConformance ;
    gmeow:exampleFile "tests/conformance-fixtures/dependency-model-approximate-lossy.ttl" ;
    gmeow:expectedOutcome gmeow:conforms ;
    gmeow:conformanceRationale "A reasoning-facing math:FactorGraph whose math:probabilityModelLowering into logic:DependencyModel carries a NON-exact logic:preservationKind (logic:SoundUnderApproximation) with its dropped constructs enumerated through logic:unsupportedConstruct exercises the lossy branch of the lowering seam; it carries no SHACL target shape and validates with no findings, dogfooding the loss ledger on the non-exact polarity." .
